Welcome to '''WikiBlueboop''', the retro-style encyclopedia under perpetual construction!

This wiki uses the blueboop theme and is powered by Wikitext and GitHub.

== How to use ==
To add a new article, simply create a new file in the <code>content/</code> folder of the GitHub repository with the extension <code>.mw</code>.

For example:
* Create <code>content/My_New_Article.mw</code>
* Link to it using <code>[[My New Article]]</code>

== Features ==
* '''Retro Theme''': Based on blueboop.is-a.dev
* '''Wikitext Support''': Supports headers, bold, italics, links, and more!
* '''Automatic Table of Contents''': Generated for articles with more than 3 sections.
* '''GitHub Powered''': Stay updated every time the repo is edited.

